  "description": [
    "Includes bibliographical references",
    "The missing ingredient in prayer -- Hard work is still in vogue -- Spiritual hypoxia -- Rescue the perishing -- Recycling righteous rubbish -- Making Christian service a joy -- Prayers for the sick : why they are and sometimes aren't answered -- I can read you like a book -- The prepaid debt -- The house of God -- Drifting without direction -- The scent of death -- Waving from the shores -- The voice of God -- The original \"blood, sweat, and tears\" speech -- What's cooking? -- It's always New Year's Eve for a Christian -- Godly gumption overcomes shyness -- Get up and grow -- An instant of understanding",
    "You are what you eat -- Tracing your spiritual genealogy -- Too obvious to accept as truth -- If life's a jungle, become a trailblazer -- The Apostle John's \"ten must wanted\" list -- A penny for your thoughts about America -- Dropping a biblical plumb line -- The revealing light -- Whom do you trust? -- The regenerating remnant -- The x factor in Christmas",
    "Life can be tough, especially if you're a man. You're supposed to be strong yet willing to cry, a financial provider yet not a \"workaholic,\" a hard-hitting businessman yet a sensitive spiritual leader. If you're not careful, the pull in all these directions will tear you apart"
  ],
